    {
      "id": "4.45.3",
      "label": "4.45.3",
      "numbers": [
        3
      ],
      "devanagari": "रामः प्रस्रवणे तस्मिन् न्यवसत् सह लक्ष्मणः\nप्रतीक्षमाणः तम् मासम् यः सीता अधिगमे कृतः |",
      "iast": "rāmaḥ prasravaṇe tasmin nyavasat saha lakṣmaṇaḥ\npratīkṣamāṇaḥ tam māsam yaḥ sītā adhigame kṛtaḥ |",
      "translation": "Rama remained on that Mt. Prasravana along with Lakshmana looking forward to that month which is marked for locating Seetha.",
