    {
      "id": "4.45.10",
      "label": "4.45.10",
      "numbers": [
        10
      ],
      "devanagari": "नदन्तः च उन्नदन्तः च गर्जन्तः च प्लवंगमाः |\nक्ष्वेलन्तो धावमानाः च विनदन्तो महाबलाः",
      "iast": "nadantaḥ ca unnadantaḥ ca garjantaḥ ca plavaṃgamāḥ |\nkṣvelanto dhāvamānāḥ ca vinadanto mahābalāḥ",
      "translation": "When those great mighty fly-jumpers have started to dash off some are bawling, some highly blaring, some more thundering, and some more oddly bellowing, while some more are roaring like lions.",
