    {
      "id": "4.45.11",
      "label": "4.45.11",
      "numbers": [
        11
      ],
      "devanagari": "एवम् संचोदिताः सर्वे राज्ञा वानर यूथपाः |\nआनयिष्यामहे सीताम् हनिष्यामः च रावणम्",
      "iast": "evam sañcoditāḥ sarve rājñā vānara yūthapāḥ |\nānayiṣyāmahe sītām haniṣyāmaḥ ca rāvaṇam",
      "translation": "Well-motivated this way by the king Sugreeva those vanara lieutenants put their fortitude into boastful words and said, \"we lead forth Seetha, we wish to kill Ravana.\"",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
