    {
      "id": "4.45.12",
      "label": "4.45.12",
      "numbers": [
        12
      ],
      "devanagari": "अहम् एको वधिष्यामि प्राप्तम् रावणम् आहवे |\nततः च उन्मथ्य सहसा हरिष्ये जनक आत्मजाम्",
      "iast": "aham eko vadhiṣyāmi prāptam rāvaṇam āhave |\ntataḥ ca unmathya sahasā hariṣye janaka ātmajām",
      "translation": "\"I will kill Ravana single-handedly if he chances on battlefield, and then on drubbing the other demons I will quickly bring back Janaka's daughter, Seetha.\" Another monkey soldier said so.",
      "notes": [],
