      "devanagari": "वेपमानम् श्रमेण अद्य भवद्भिः स्थीयताम् इति |\nएक एव आहरिष्यामि पातालात् अपि जानकीम्",
      "iast": "vepamānam śrameṇa adya bhavadbhiḥ sthīyatām iti |\neka eva āhariṣyāmi pātālāt api jānakīm",
      "translation": "\"I alone will bring back Janaki even from netherworlds, who might be shivering owing to enervation, and you my monkey-soldier colleagues, you all may stay behind now.\" Thus another monkey-hero said.",
