      "label": "4.45.14",
      "numbers": [
        14
      ],
      "devanagari": "विधमिष्यामि अहम् वृक्षान् दारयिष्यामि अहम् गिरीन् |\nधरणीम् दारयिष्यामि क्षोभयिष्यामि सागरान्",
      "iast": "vidhamiṣyāmi aham vṛkṣān dārayiṣyāmi aham girīn |\ndharaṇīm dārayiṣyāmi kṣobhayiṣyāmi sāgarān",
      "translation": "\"I will completely shatter the trees, shred the mountains, split the earth and storm the oceans.\" Thus another monkey gave war cry.",
