    {
      "id": "4.45.16",
      "label": "4.45.16",
      "numbers": [
        16
      ],
      "devanagari": "भू तले सागरे वा अपि शैलेषु च वनेषु च |\nपातालस्य अपि वा मध्ये न मम आच्छिद्यते गतिः",
      "iast": "bhū tale sāgare vā api śaileṣu ca vaneṣu ca |\npātālasya api vā madhye na mama ācchidyate gatiḥ",
      "translation": "\"My transit cannot be thwarted either on the plane of earth, or in the ocean, or on mountains or in forests, or in the netherworld, or in its core.\" This is the slogan of another monkey-warrior.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
